&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20150321125209/http:/www.cdt-uba.org/"&gt;Carrera de Diseño de Tipografía (CDT-UBA)&lt;/a&gt; (1 and a half-year postgraduate course) at &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20150321125209/http:/www.uba.ar/"&gt;Universidad de Buenos Aires (UBA)&lt;/a&gt;, Buenos Aires, Argentina&lt;br&gt;
