&lt;li&gt;The &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20150321125209/http:/coopertype.org/"&gt;Type@Cooper&lt;/a&gt; certificate programs at the Cooper Union in New York City. Language: English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certificate of Advanced Studies (CAS) Type Design at &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20150321125209/http:/weiterbildung.zhdk.ch/angebot.php?id=3119"&gt;Hochschule der Künste&lt;/a&gt;, Zürich, Switzerland. 1-year part-time program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master of Advanced Studies (MAS) in Type Design and Typography at &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20150321125209/http:/weiterbildung.zhdk.ch/angebot.php?id=3116"&gt;Hochschule der Künste&lt;/a&gt;, Zürich, Switzerland. 2-year part-time program.&lt;br&gt;
