&lt;li&gt;‘DSAA Création Typographique’ (2-year program) at &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20150321125209/http:/typophile.com/wiki/%C3%89cole%20Sup%C3%A9rieure%20Estienne%20des%20Arts%20et%20Industries%20Graphiques"&gt;Ecole Estienne&lt;/a&gt;, Paris, France&lt;br&gt;
Language: French&lt;/li&gt;
